---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Services" description="Consulting, events, and ecosystem access for Chinese AI companies landing in Singapore and going global.">
  <section class="services-hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="label">Services</div>
      <h1>Your first call<br>in Singapore</h1>
      <p class="hero-desc">
        If you're a Chinese AI company thinking about going global — and Singapore
        is on your list — I can help you skip the trial-and-error phase. I have
        direct access to the resources, networks, and institutional knowledge
        that matter here.
      </p>
      <a href="mailto:ellen@theaiduet.com" class="hero-cta">Start a conversation →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="offerings">
    <div class="offerings-inner">

      <div class="offering">
        <div class="offering-number">01</div>
        <div class="offering-content">
          <h2>Landing Events</h2>
          <p>
            Curated 80–100 person events that introduce your company to Singapore's
            AI ecosystem — investors, government officials, founders, and press.
            Not generic networking; designed specifically for your company's positioning
            and the audience that matters for your next step.
          </p>
          <div class="offering-details">
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>What you get</strong>
              <span>Event design, venue, guest curation, on-the-ground execution, and post-event introductions</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>Who it's for</strong>
              <span>AI companies making their first or second move into Singapore and need visibility with the right people</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="offering">
        <div class="offering-number">02</div>
        <div class="offering-content">
          <h2>Resource Matching</h2>
          <p>
            Direct introductions to EDB, IMDA, SuperAI, local investors, cloud
            providers (Google Cloud, BytePlus, Vercel), compliance advisors, and
            ecosystem partners. I connect you to the people who matter — not a
            directory, but curated, contextual introductions where both sides
            are prepared.
          </p>
          <div class="offering-details">
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>What you get</strong>
              <span>Targeted introductions with context, prep support, and follow-up facilitation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>Who it's for</strong>
              <span>Founders who need the right doors opened, not more networking events</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="offering">
        <div class="offering-number">03</div>
        <div class="offering-content">
          <h2>Fundraising Advisory</h2>
          <p>
            For companies ready to raise in Singapore and SEA — deal positioning,
            investor introductions, narrative development, and deck review. I work
            at the intersection of Chinese AI and international capital, through
            Semmering, the advisory practice I co-run with my partner.
          </p>
          <div class="offering-details">
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>What you get</strong>
              <span>Investor mapping, positioning strategy, materials review, and warm introductions</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>Who it's for</strong>
              <span>AI companies with product-market fit looking to raise from Singapore/SEA-based investors</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="offering">
        <div class="offering-number">04</div>
        <div class="offering-content">
          <h2>Go-to-Market Consulting</h2>
          <p>
            Strategic advisory for Chinese AI companies entering international
            markets through Singapore. Covers entity structure, hiring strategy,
            positioning for local market, partnership development, and the
            operational playbook for going from "China company with a Singapore
            address" to "Singapore-based global company."
          </p>
          <div class="offering-details">
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>What you get</strong>
              <span>Market entry strategy, operational roadmap, and ongoing advisory support</span>
            </div>
            <div class="detail">
              <strong>Who it's for</strong>
              <span>AI companies serious about making Singapore a real hub, not a mailbox</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-me">
    <div class="why-inner">
      <h2>Why work with me</h2>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-item">
          <h3>I'm in the network</h3>
          <p>I organize events connecting Chinese AI founders with EDB, IRAS/ISCA, Google Cloud, BytePlus, Vercel, and the broader Singapore ecosystem. These aren't cold introductions — they're warm connections built through years of relationship-building.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h3>I understand both sides</h3>
          <p>Peking University educated, Beijing VC fund experience, now based in Singapore. I think in Chinese but operate in English. I know what Chinese founders need and what Singapore institutions expect.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <h3>I write about what I learn</h3>
          <p>The AI Duet isn't just marketing — it's how I process and share real ecosystem knowledge. My Field Notes come from actual meetings, actual founder conversations, actual policy briefings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="services-cta-section">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Let's talk</h2>
      <p>Every engagement starts with a conversation. Tell me where you are, where you want to go, and what's in the way.</p>
      <a href="mailto:ellen@theaiduet.com" class="cta-btn">ellen@theaiduet.com →</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .services-hero {
    padding: 100px var(--spacing-page) 80px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .hero-inner { max-width: var(--prose-width); margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero-inner .label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .services-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 52px; font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -1.5px; margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero-desc {
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px;
    background: var(--color-text); color: var(--color-bg);
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .hero-cta:hover { background: var(--color-accent); opacity: 1; }

  .offerings { padding: 80px var(--spacing-page); }
  .offerings-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .offering {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr; gap: 24px;
    padding: 48px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .offering:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .offering-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-accent); padding-top: 4px;
  }
  .offering-content h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .offering-content > p {
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .offering-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  .detail strong {
    display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 4px; color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .detail span { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }

  .why-me {
    padding: 80px var(--spacing-page);
    background: var(--color-text); color: white;
  }
  .why-inner { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .why-me h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; }
  .why-item h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .why-item p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }

  .services-cta-section { padding: 80px var(--spacing-page); text-align: center; }
  .cta-inner { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .cta-inner h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .cta-inner p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .cta-btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 14px 28px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-text); border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--color-text); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .cta-btn:hover { border-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent); opacity: 1; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services-hero { padding: 64px 20px 48px; }
    .services-hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
    .offerings { padding: 48px 20px; }
    .offering { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
    .offering-number { padding-top: 0; }
    .offering-details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .why-me { padding: 60px 20px; }
    .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .services-cta-section { padding: 60px 20px; }
  }
</style>
